ths contain symlinks (e.g. `packages/upgrade/static/src/...` --> `packages/upgrade/src/static/...`), the links to source generated on the API docs use the \"unnormalized\" path, and lead to 404 on GitHub (which doesn't know about the symlinks). E.g. [UpgrradeModule][1].\r\n\r\nThe links are generated based on `doc.fileInfo.projectRelativePath` ([here][2]), which in turn comes from the dgeni-packages (either [here][3] or [there][4], I assume).\r\n\r\nThis could be solved by using [fs.realpath()][5] to get to the actual file path (without symlinks), but I am not sure if updating the existing `FileInfo` properties is appropriate or a new property needs to be added.\r\n\r\ncc @petebacondarwin \r\n\r\n[1]: https://angular.io/api/upgrade/static/UpgradeModule\r\n[2]: https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/b582e2b311a42a8ead96da7a5317626f80a89246/aio/tools/transforms/templates/api/lib/githubLinks.html#L2\r\n[3]: https://github.com/angular/dgeni-packages/blob/89a47d4b2311fea5177c465871cf0499b0da17b8/typescript/src/services/TsParser/FileInfo.ts#L14\r\n[4]: https://github.com/angular/dgeni-packages/blob/8264c20a1f70287a12fea595bffbbdb081234cdf/base/processors/read-files.js#L102\r\n[5]: https://nodejs.org/api/fs.html#fs_fs_realpath_path_options_callback","closed_by":{"login":"alxhub","id":4175141,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNzUxNDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4175141?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub","html_url":"https://github.com/alxhub","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alxhub/repos","events_url":"https: